The Archive is a library reached through the threshold in the Threshold Expeditions office of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]]. It is a ruin now, one great heap of books under a dark open space, with the bodies of an Oreskian expedition scattered through the pile. The expedition went in without knowing what waited there, and the Archive took what they knew; some of what they carried still lies where they fell. The Archive was known to the [[People/Althane/The Broker|Broker]]. When strangers arrive, loose books rise off the heap and stack themselves into a man-shaped figure, and worse things come up out of the ink.
